{
  "comment": [
    "The duty window («Реєстр досліджень», the mockup's body[data-f=duty]): every picture the mockup draws with CSS.",
    "Sizes are layout units; drawn at 1.5 px per unit. White pictures are tinted in the game (the layout's color or SetColor);",
    "the four node forms (form_*) and sheet_glow keep their own colours and are shown with color 1 1 1 1.",
    "Rules (.cell, .dsk, .ttl, .seal) come from duty.css; the rest is inline, with the mockup's values.",
    "grif, title, seal_done and seal_work hold text, so each has a _ua and an _en picture (STR_OZL_SKIN_DUTY_*_IMG).",
    "dots, dash_h and dash_v are tiles: 8 units at 2 px per unit fill their 16x16 canvas pixel for pixel, and a layout",
    "shows them without stretch mode, so they repeat at their own pixel size along a 1-unit line."
  ],
  "scale": 1.5,
  "css": ["duty.css"],
  "body": { "data-f": "duty" },
